== 9. Alpha finishes task 4
-> {"action": "post", "body": "Alerts audited", "kind": "done", "reply_to": 4, "submission_id": "submission-6", "token": "<token-2>", "workspace": "<workspace-1>"}
<- {
  "result": {
    "message_id": 6
  }
}

== 10. Alpha blocks task 1
-> {"action": "post", "body": "Stuck on access", "kind": "blocker", "reply_to": 1, "submission_id": "submission-7", "token": "<token-2>", "workspace": "<workspace-1>"}
<- {
  "result": {
    "message_id": 7
  }
}

== 11. Alpha offers task 1 to Bravo
-> {"action": "post", "body": "Please take over", "kind": "handoff", "reply_to": 1, "submission_id": "submission-8", "to": "Bravo", "token": "<token-2>", "workspace": "<workspace-1>"}
<- {
  "result": {
    "message_id": 8
  }
}

== 12. lead retires Alpha
-> {"action": "retire", "name": "alpha", "token": "<token-1>", "workspace": "<workspace-1>"}
<- {
  "result": {
    "participant": "Alpha",
    "retired": true
  }
}

== 13. Bravo's accept of the cancelled offer is stale
-> {"action": "post", "body": "Taking over", "kind": "accept", "reply_to": 8, "submission_id": "submission-9", "token": "<token-3>", "workspace": "<workspace-1>"}
<- {
  "error": "This handoff is no longer pending"
}

== 14. a task to the retired member is refused
-> {"action": "post", "body": "More", "due_minutes": 5, "kind": "task", "submission_id": "submission-10", "to": "Alpha", "token": "<token-1>", "workspace": "<workspace-1>"}
<- {
  "error": "Cannot assign a task or handoff to a retired participant"
}

